  "swagger": "2.0",
  "info": {
    "title": "Publish Global Product",
    "version": "202309",
    "description": "Publish and convert a global product to local products in one or multiple shops in supported markets. After publishing, the product is sent for review by TikTok Shop in the respective markets. For sellers in the EU market, the provided information will also be automatically translated into all EU languages supported by TikTok Shop.\n**Note**:\n\n* You can only publish in each market once. To change product information, edit the global product by using the [Edit Global Product API](6509e1bcc16ffe02b8dc3cd7). The changes will be automatically synchronized to all markets where the product is published\n* Use the [Get Product API](6509d85b4a0bb702c057fdda) to obtain the converted local product information in the target market's language.\n* Use the [Edit Product API](6509da7d0fcef602bf1caddf) or [Partial Edit Product API](650a98d74a0bb702c06c3289) to edit the local product information, if necessary."
  },
